  "look": {
    "zh": "ECHO 第 3 周目「真實的樣子」（只在私人頻道出現；2026-11-11 使用者選定「卸下管制官」）\n【臉與髮】和 ECHO 同一張臉、黑色短髮到下巴、斜瀏海、內層淡藍挑染、資料埠形狀的髮夾；髮尾的光從淡藍變成暖白。\n【不一樣的地方】拿掉耳機與麥克風（不再對誰報告）；眼睛的刻度環消失，一般的淡藍瞳孔；白色連帽外套好好穿在兩肩上（不再從肩膀滑落）；內搭換成淡藍的高領針織毛衣，胸前只有一顆小小的白色星星（她送出的求救訊號）；黑色工裝褲照舊。\n【表情】偏柔和，和第 1 周目的「完美」對比。\n【定稿紀錄】p1＝從 ECHO 的 p1 主圖以 Qwen 改服裝（候選 2 號，種子 22，使用者選定）；p3 坦白＝從這張改姿勢。",
    "prompt": "1girl, solo, adult, slender, medium breasts, short hair, black hair, chin-length bob, swept bangs, hair over one eyebrow, colored inner hair, (pale blue inner hair:1.1), white glowing hair tips, small silver rectangular hairclip, (pale blue eyes:1.1), calm, narrow eyes, light smile, white hooded jacket, open jacket, pale blue sweater, turtleneck sweater, ribbed sweater, small white star emblem, black cargo pants, black and white color scheme, pale blue accents",
    "neg": "navel, midriff, crop top, planet, saturn, long hair, ponytail, red, orange, yellow, green, pink, hat, glasses, microphone in front of mouth, large breasts, huge breasts, dark background, gradient background, halo, text, letters, mascot, stuffed toy, skull, keychain doll, (cyan:1.2), neon, over-ear headphones, headphones, headset, earpiece, microphone, constellation, ringed eyes"
  },
